# One block. One Cache-Control for the whole site.
#
# Cloudflare Pages applies every block whose pattern matches the path and
# concatenates a header that appears in more than one of them. Overlapping
# patterns stack rather than override: a /* rule plus an /assets/* rule made
# /assets/site.css come back as
#   Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
# Two blocks with the SAME pattern do replace each other, which is how an earlier
# version of this file (a second /* carrying only Cache-Control) silently dropped
# every security header above it, with the text still on disk and none of it on
# the wire. `npm run check:headers` asserts the live response, not this file.
#
# So there is one block and nothing overrides anything: the whole site
# revalidates. Nothing here is content-hashed, so a year-long cache would mean a
# deploy that edits site.css ships the same URL and no returning visitor ever
# sees it. That shipped: the utility site served a months-old scanner whose
# button was dead and whose camera never opened, while ninety tests passed
# against the working tree. Revalidation is one conditional request per load, and
# it is the only policy under which deploying without a build step is safe.
#
# The zone's Browser Cache TTL was also set to 4 hours, which overrides this
# header for anything Cloudflare considers cacheable. It is set to "Respect
# Existing Headers" so that this value is the one that reaches the browser. See
# docs/decisions.md.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
